Description: Member and subscription management for solidarity farms (WirGarten)
 Tapir manages members, subscriptions, coop shares, deliveries and payments.
 .
 This package is self-contained: it ships its own CPython, a virtualenv with
 all Python dependencies and the built frontend under /opt/tapir. It provides
 systemd units for gunicorn, the celery worker and celery beat (tapir.target).
 Configuration lives in /etc/tapir/tapir.env, state in /var/lib/tapir.
